---
import Link from "../common/link.astro";
---

<main class="space-y-6 max-w-xl mx-auto px-4 lg:px-0">
  <div class="">
    <h1 class="text-2xl text-foreground font-medium">
      advait <span class="text-xs text-muted-foreground"
        >(advtszn)</span
      >
    </h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground font-medium">
      multi-disciplinary engineer
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="space-y-6 leading-[150%] text-justify">
    <p>
      software engineer at <Link href="https://wldd.in" target="_blank"
        >wldd.in</Link
      >; prev. <Link href="/works/kimchipremium">kimchipremium.io</Link>. my
      day-to-day revolves around backend, but im really obsessive about good
      typography and ux
    </p>

    <div class="space-y-2">
      <h2 class="font-medium">btw i love shipping:</h2>

      <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2">
        <li>
          worked on <Link href="/works/listablelabs">listable labs</Link
          >; prompt eval pipeline, background job processing, multi-tenant blogs
          on custom domains
        </li>

        <li>
          <Link href="/works/kimchipremium">kimchipremium</Link>, built an
          aggregator that scrapes and publishes ~100 crypto headlines a day (278
          at peak)
        </li>

        <li>
          built <Link href="/works/orbe">orbe</Link>; an outreach os that
          enriches a lead from email and writes a personalized outreach email
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>

  <p>
    outside tech, i've dabbled in a few other things, i used to post anime
    edits, designed <Link href="/archive">cover arts</Link> and even tried music production
    for a bit.
  </p>
</main>
